# Model mistakes include a canonical suggestion.

```console
$ lllm --catalog catalog.toml resolve --model local/fixtur
? 2
error: model selector `local/fixtur` was not found. Did you mean `local/fixture`?
  caused by: model selector `local/fixtur` was not found

$ lllm resolve --model-query definitely-missing
? 2
error: no model with a compiled adapter matches query: definitely-missing

```
